#. Description of the plugin
#: 99trace-posthog-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Every WooCommerce order in PostHog, exactly once, on the visitor who placed it. Purchases, refunds and cancellations are sent by your shop's server, so bank redirects, ad blockers and in-app browsers no longer lose them; posthog-js and the server share one visitor ID."
msgstr ""

