#: src/Admin.php:324
msgid "Read the visitor from key"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin.php:327
msgid "Only while another PostHog plugin still runs PostHog in the browser and 99Trace sends from the server only (a pilot beside it): the project key whose PostHog cookie names the visitor. Empty: that plugin's key. Not used once 99Trace runs PostHog in the browser: then the visitor is always in PostHog's standard cookie for the project key above, the same cookie other PostHog plugins use, so replacing another plugin with the same project key keeps every visitor."
msgstr ""

