#: src/Privacy.php:44
msgid "Suggested text:"
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:44
msgid "We use PostHog, a product analytics service, to understand how visitors use our shop and to count our orders correctly."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:47
msgid "After you accept statistics cookies, PostHog runs in your browser and records the pages you view, the buttons and links you click, how far you scroll, and technical details such as your browser, device and screen size. It keeps an anonymous visitor ID in cookies whose names start with ph_, so that your visits can be recognised."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:48
msgid "PostHog runs in your browser and records the pages you view, the buttons and links you click, how far you scroll, and technical details such as your browser, device and screen size. It keeps an anonymous visitor ID in cookies whose names start with ph_, so that your visits can be recognised."
